      "Ultimately, in economies propelled by relentless innovation, sustainable competitive advantage no longer resides in any single product, patent, or market position. The only truly durable advantage is an organisational meta-capability: the institutional agility to sense emerging shifts early, reconfigure resources rapidly, and reinvent the enterprise's value proposition continuously."
