      "NEGOTIATION STRATEGY & BEHAVIOURAL DEALMAKING BRIEFING — EUROPEAN CENTRE FOR EXECUTIVE NEGOTIATION (LONDON - GENEVA). To: The Commercial Dealmaking Team of 'Continental Precision Systems SA'. Subject: Structuring disciplined concession choreography and overcoming the value-destroying traps of pure distributive bargaining. In commercial negotiations, the manner in which parties sequence, frame, and condition their concessions frequently exerts a greater influence on final transaction economics than the objective financial merits of their opening proposals.",
