"Ultimately, state economic sovereignty in a financially interconnected world is not an absolute legal entitlement immune from arithmetic reality. Genuine fiscal and policy autonomy is earned through institutional credibility, productive public investment that expands long-term tax capacity, and balanced financial architectures that harness global capital without surrendering domestic democratic choices."
