"Ultimately, mobilising private capital for Africa's strategic infrastructure is a challenge of financial engineering and institutional execution rather than capital scarcity. By scaling bankable project-preparation facilities, recycling operational brownfield assets, and activating domestic pension funds, Africa can finance modern infrastructure at continental scale."
