"Ultimately, African entrepreneurship suffers from no deficit of ambition, engineering talent, or addressable market demand. Aligning international legal interoperability, local-currency growth instruments, and indigenous institutional capital will enable Africa's entrepreneurs to scale globally on their own terms."
